                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5aaeed01-40ee-4be2-8ad2-41126cdfff08",
                        "source_entry_id": "d36cb47a-fec6-3fc0-af82-6b394e14fcdb",
                        "source_sense_id": "ba1507e5-4b49-3709-92a8-e7cc416a6e75",
                        "target_lang_word": "suddenly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "suddenly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "381904d2-a0fa-3869-80f8-713229bcd1f1",
                                        "entry_id": "b4602e66-3e9c-3a64-b1ba-c57b0f38c649",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Happening quickly and with little or no warning; in a sudden manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e6e4ae1-a56b-4ffc-ad0e-daf126075dae",
                                                "sense_id": "381904d2-a0fa-3869-80f8-713229bcd1f1",
                                                "text": "Suddenly, the heavens opened and we all got drenched."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b0aeef6-4f88-446a-9597-009ef96f1f4e",
                                                "sense_id": "381904d2-a0fa-3869-80f8-713229bcd1f1",
                                                "text": "They've suddenly decided to sell the house."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3063b5d4-74b7-4262-8a9e-66623a1457a3",
                                                "sense_id": "381904d2-a0fa-3869-80f8-713229bcd1f1",
                                                "text": "The king before he would take his voyage, sent the Erle of Huntyngdon to ſerche and ſcowre the Seas, leaſt any Frenchmen lyeng in wayte for him might attrap him sodeinly, or he had any knowledge of their ſetting forward."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0e96555-43e8-4e9d-bdbf-8a130168d0d6",
                                                "sense_id": "381904d2-a0fa-3869-80f8-713229bcd1f1",
                                                "text": "But ever since the concept of \"hamartia\" recurred through Aristotle's Poetics, in an attempt to describe man's ingrained iniquity, our impulse has been to identify a telling defect in those brought suddenly and dramatically low."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "af5fab7a-becb-494d-bbd6-c0b5d66ded2e",
                        "source_entry_id": "d36cb47a-fec6-3fc0-af82-6b394e14fcdb",
                        "source_sense_id": "ba1507e5-4b49-3709-92a8-e7cc416a6e75",
                        "target_lang_word": "all of a sudden",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "all of a sudden",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ab9defb-0a6a-3249-ba24-7b37df983413",
                                        "entry_id": "118adcfd-ffa7-3962-9445-9c9f60e3be16",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Suddenly, quickly, without warning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4d134a2-08da-4c16-97e7-3f066e4d1d59",
                                                "sense_id": "2ab9defb-0a6a-3249-ba24-7b37df983413",
                                                "text": "All of a sudden I felt very hot and tired."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8c1973a-e386-46d9-97ce-b833b320ff82",
                                                "sense_id": "2ab9defb-0a6a-3249-ba24-7b37df983413",
                                                "text": "― Enju: “Wh-What?! What are you saying all of a sudden?! Idiot! Hentai!”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dca69597-1ad6-4938-9abf-380f009c3fa9",
                        "source_entry_id": "d36cb47a-fec6-3fc0-af82-6b394e14fcdb",
                        "source_sense_id": "ba1507e5-4b49-3709-92a8-e7cc416a6e75",
                        "target_lang_word": "soudain",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "soudain",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ebc3b9a-8652-3062-8b96-6c0d957e8649",
                                        "entry_id": "30ebc4ed-f266-337c-a436-d205f05ae200",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est subit, prompt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ed2b22c-b5a6-4db5-b7c0-b85196444d2e",
                                                "sense_id": "6ebc3b9a-8652-3062-8b96-6c0d957e8649",
                                                "text": "La soudaine irruption d’un ennemi prêt à l’offensive n’eut d’autre effet immédiat sur New York que d’accroître sa véhémence habituelle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7596f5c-5c6c-4aef-aaf8-eceef529275f",
                                                "sense_id": "6ebc3b9a-8652-3062-8b96-6c0d957e8649",
                                                "text": "Et puis, si aucun cataclysme soudain n’a décisivement transformé l’aspect naturel des choses, d’un seul coup, depuis un siècle, il est cependant vrai qu'au ralenti une catastrophe inéluctable impose à cette partie de la France, cette fatale loi d’impermanence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bf931ac-c04c-4b6a-8b44-df8934dd5233",
                                                "sense_id": "6ebc3b9a-8652-3062-8b96-6c0d957e8649",
                                                "text": "Et, tournant à son tour les yeux vers la portière, il s’abîma dans une soudaine et muette rêverie. Le balancement de la voiture l’engourdissait."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efb1be49-16bc-4d26-952f-682228661e6d",
                                                "sense_id": "6ebc3b9a-8652-3062-8b96-6c0d957e8649",
                                                "text": "Toutefois la pacification des villes ne va pas sans réactions parfois violentes et soudaines de fanatiques irréductibles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "soudain",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c7dc208-69a8-3b6b-a936-0a56fddc078d",
                                        "entry_id": "bb8bc1c3-b071-3f57-ae7f-3ec881ccaf8f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dans le même instant ; aussitôt ; tout d’un coup."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e77a3968-a2b2-4413-a48f-45f57f4c0a46",
                                                "sense_id": "2c7dc208-69a8-3b6b-a936-0a56fddc078d",
                                                "text": "La partie repart, les clients sadiques s’approchent, soudain intéressés de voir un froggy en situation délicate, et arrive mon tour."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "322a75e0-602d-4655-ae3d-698a73e1928a",
                                                "sense_id": "2c7dc208-69a8-3b6b-a936-0a56fddc078d",
                                                "text": "Soudain, la chaîne du vélo casse alors que je suis tout près du village de Voves en Eure-et-Loir, à une vingtaine de kilomètres de Chartres."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3d170986-4135-4d4b-bab4-6eab5c839979",
                        "source_entry_id": "d36cb47a-fec6-3fc0-af82-6b394e14fcdb",
                        "source_sense_id": "ba1507e5-4b49-3709-92a8-e7cc416a6e75",
